msgid "Players can gain a rating on the Multiplayer Lobby that reflects their skill at the game."
msgstr "Pemain bisa mendapatkan peringkat di Lobi Main Bersama yang mencerminkan keahlian mereka dalam permainan."

msgid "Players can make alliances and declare war on allies."
